{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Solve Timeloop Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/Timebound_gif01.gif?t=1750236100\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some areas in Timebound are enchanted with timeloop magic. After a few steps, you're sent back to where you entered. Use these simple rules and see just how far they can take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Learn the Rules... and Break Them</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/Timebound_gif02.gif?t=1750236100\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every puzzle is handcrafted to teach you something new. There's no filler or chores, no hand-holding. You will need to figure it out on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover What's Hidden In Plain Sight </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/Timebound_gif03.gif?t=1750236100\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is deeply interconnected - your progress is only limited by your knowledge of the game\u2019s systems, not by artificial unlocks. What seemed impossible before might just need a second look. Yes, you could have done that the entire time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Puzzle Design</strong> -  Solve puzzles by manipulating local timeloops in creative ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Knowledge-based Progression </strong> - Explore an open world where your only limit is what you know.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Secrets &amp; meta puzzles</strong> - Think outside the box to solve layered, interconnected puzzles. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3220700?t=1750236100","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3220700?t=1750236100","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/60af1275817c134efea9f60648b211a01ce21192/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750236100","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/60af1275817c134efea9f60648b211a01ce21192/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750236100","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Solve Timeloop Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/Timebound_gif01.gif?t=1750236100\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some areas in Timebound are enchanted with timeloop magic. After a few steps, you're sent back to where you entered. Use these simple rules and see just how far they can take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Learn the Rules... and Break Them</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/Timebound_gif02.gif?t=1750236100\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every puzzle is handcrafted to teach you something new. There's no filler or chores, no hand-holding. You will need to figure it out on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover What's Hidden In Plain Sight </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img clas